SUMMARY:The Buena Vista Orchestra
LOCATION:Academy of Music\, 274 Main St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:DSP Shows presents\nTHE BUENA VISTA ORCHESTRA (sometimes referr
 ed to as The Buena Vista Social Orchestra\, Orquesta Buena Vista\, etc) is
  the world’s foremost Cuban music repertory ensemble – featuring a lin
 eup of musicians from groups like The Buena Vista Social Club\, AfroCuban 
 All Stars\, the bands of Celia Cruz\, Omara Portuondo\, Chucho Valdés\, W
 illie Colon & more!\nhttps://aomtheatre.com/aom_event/the-buena-vista-orch
 estra/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
